 Copper Coil fabricated.\nField Fabricator: Bored Alloy Barrel fabricated. Fit it to your pistol.\nField Fabricator: Bored Alloy Barrel fitted. Damage 34 \u2192 40.8 \u00b7 Range 70 m \u2192 80 m\nWarden Ossa: Now it hits like it means it. The workers won't shrug that off. Reward: 25 credits.\nWarden Ossa: Listen. Something big just woke in the depot's processing hall: a foreman unit, still running its old shift. It's slow, but it hits hard and shrugs off a stagger. When its optics flare red, step back. Put it down and bring me its control core.\nOuter Berms: You go down in the dust. A Warden patrol drags you back to the post.\nSystem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nDev: Received 0 credits and 11 \u00d7 Scrap Alloy.\nDev: Received 0 credits and 50 \u00d7 Nanite Residue.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Micro Capacitor \u00d71 \u00b7 pack full, left in the cache: Scrap Alloy \u00d72, Nanite Residue \u00d72","bounds":[42,438,368,617],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element"]},{"name":"unity-slider","type":"ScrollerSlider","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider--vertical","unity-base-field","unity-base-slider","unity-scroller__slider","unity-slider","unity-base-field--no-label"]},{"name":"unity-drag-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__drag-container"]},{"name":"unity-tracker","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__tracker"]},{"name":"unity-dragger","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[419,981,18,8],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__dragger"]},{"name":"chat-footer","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[42,1021,386,27],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["chat-foote